Package: nepstest
Title: Test NEPS Field Data Deliveries Against the Programming Templates
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Alexander", "Helbig", , "alexander.helbig@wzb.eu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "YOUR-ORCID-ID"))
Description: Checks field data deliveries of the National Educational Panel Study
    (NEPS) against the programming templates (PVs): entry filters (ef-tags),
    autocodings (ac-tags), date ranges (ra-tags), variable labels and value
    labels. Older exit filters (af-tags) are still supported.
